^{:go/end 3513} (go/func splitShiftConst "splitShiftConst attempts to split a constant into a signed 12 bit or\n32 bit integer, with corresponding logical right shift and/or left shift.\n" [^int64 v] :results [^int64 imm ^int lsh ^int rsh ^bool ok]
